{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51137","headline":"白龟城 · 左匡政","name":"白龟城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城堞千寻险，池隍十里余。\n楼台侵汉宇，鼓角动郊墟。\n罴虎三军拥，壶浆万户舒。\n急须修表进，天意欲何如？\n（《嘉庆泾县志》三十二《词赋》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"左匡政","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51137.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51137","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}